      "title": "TCP: replace pseudo booleans with bool's",
      "message": "TCP: replace pseudo booleans with bool's\n\nVarious variants of fields are used as boolean, for lack of better\nsupport in the C language. Now that \"real bool's\" have become\navailable with the use of C11, replace these fields with bool's.\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit c3d1ea231aedc43c4f657b96c1ac26c9093a7089)\n\nCo-authored-by: Jaap Keuter <jaap.keuter@xs4all.nl>",
